sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title HackMatch — US-027: Administrative Account Enforcement — Verified Deletion Sequence
    actor Admin
    participant ReactUI
    participant ExpressAPI
    participant DeletionService
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant FirebaseAuth

    Admin->>ReactUI: Confirm ownership and enter reason
    ReactUI->>ExpressAPI: POST /api/admin/accounts/:accountId/delete
    ExpressAPI->>ExpressAPI: Verify token, MFA, active stored ADMIN, and input
    ExpressAPI->>DeletionService: Reject self-delete, ADMIN target, or unverified ownership
    DeletionService->>PostgreSQL: Load target and existing deletion request
    DeletionService->>PostgreSQL: Find owned unlocked non-disbanded teams
    alt Unlocked owned team exists
        DeletionService->>PostgreSQL: Create or update BlockedNeedsDisband request
        DeletionService->>PostgreSQL: Append blocked account_delete action record
        DeletionService-->>ReactUI: 409 with safe block reason and request state
        ReactUI-->>Admin: Preserve draft and require team disband first
    else Eligible for processing
        DeletionService->>PostgreSQL: Create or resume request and mark Processing
        DeletionService->>FirebaseAuth: Revoke refresh tokens
        FirebaseAuth-->>DeletionService: Revoked or 502 partial failure
        DeletionService->>PostgreSQL: Apply suspension cascade
        DeletionService->>PostgreSQL: Pseudonymize membership identity snapshots
        DeletionService->>PostgreSQL: Tombstone participant and clear profile, skills, portfolios, providers, and MFA challenges
        DeletionService->>FirebaseAuth: Delete Firebase user
        FirebaseAuth-->>DeletionService: Deleted or 502 partial failure
        alt Firebase deletion or later persistence fails
            DeletionService-->>ReactUI: Explicit retryable partial-failure response
            ReactUI-->>Admin: Keep account context and show current progress
        else Processing completes
            DeletionService->>PostgreSQL: Mark request Completed with safe summary
            DeletionService->>PostgreSQL: Append account_delete action record
            PostgreSQL-->>DeletionService: Completion time and preserved membership IDs
            DeletionService-->>ReactUI: 200 deactivated account and deletion outcome
            ReactUI-->>Admin: Show live PII erased and historical roster integrity preserved
        end
    end

    Note over DeletionService,PostgreSQL: The 30-day value is a proposed processing target. Current code performs live processing immediately and does not claim automatic legal compliance.
    Note over DeletionService,PostgreSQL: Membership rows and structural roster fields remain. Identity snapshot fields are replaced with a stable non-identifying label.
    Note over DeletionService,FirebaseAuth: Database request states, cascade, pseudonymization, PII erasure, Firebase operations, completion, and audit are sequential without a distributed transaction or compensation workflow.

